sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant BBR as BBR ExtProc<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant EPP as EPP ExtProc<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant DataLayer as EPP Data Layer
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod<br/>(vLLM / SGLang)

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Body-Based Routing (BBR) — Optional

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS TLS
    Gateway->>BBR: ext-proc RequestBody callout<br/>gRPC TLS
    BBR->>BBR: Parse body, extract model name
    BBR-->>Gateway: HeaderMutation: x-model-name=llama3<br/>gRPC TLS
    Gateway->>Gateway: Route based on model header<br/>→ matching InferencePool

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 2: Inference Request Routing (EPP)

    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc RequestHeaders callout<br/>gRPC TLS 9002/TCP
    EPP->>EPP: Parse request (OpenAI/vLLM/passthrough)
    EPP->>EPP: Run request control plugins<br/>(admit/annotate/reject)

    Note over EPP,DataLayer: Scheduling Pipeline

    EPP->>DataLayer: Get endpoint metrics
    DataLayer-->>EPP: KV-cache, queue depth,<br/>LoRA adapters, running requests

    EPP->>EPP: Filter → Score → Pick<br/>(KV-cache aware, LoRA affinity,<br/>prefix cache, latency prediction)

    EPP-->>Gateway: Selected endpoint address<br/>+ routing headers<br/>gRPC TLS

    Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward inference request<br/>to selected pod

    ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over DataLayer,ModelServer: Background: Metrics Scraping (50ms default)

    loop Every 50ms (configurable)
        DataLayer->>ModelServer: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP (InsecureSkipVerify default)
        ModelServer-->>DataLayer: Prometheus metrics<br/>(kv_cache_usage, queue_size, etc.)
    end
